    "text": "spectrumlocalnews.com\nwebsite\nBelleville\nMarshmallow's Hope to expand mental health services in Belleville\nBy Elizabeth Barmeier,\n8 hours agoBELLEVILLE, Ill. — After her son, Zachary, died by suicide in 2018, Laura Kane become a clinician and founded Marshmallow’s Hope to help others. Headquartered in Rockford, Ill., the organization is expanding to Belleville. After speaking with Healthcare and Family Service (HFS) leaders, Kane found that southern Illinois...\n1",
